    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## CSR-02 | Support Response Approval\n\nPurpose\nCollect a human decision on a proposed support response.\n\nFlow\nReceive the action from CSR-01 → email the reviewer\n→ wait for approval or rejection → update the records.\n\nApproved\nAction_Log: Approved\nSupport_Tickets: READY_TO_EXECUTE\n\nRejected\nAction_Log: Rejected / Cancelled\nSupport_Tickets: NEEDS_REVISION\n\nApproval authorizes the saved response for sending.\nIt does not execute a refund or replacement.\nCSR-03 sends eligible responses separately.\n\n**Author: Maha**\nAI automation and product focused roles",
        "height": 464,
        "width": 352
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -608,
        -160
      ],
      "id": "54164483-4720-4e6b-865b-07c729acd9ef",
      "name": "Sticky Note"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 1. Reviewer Decision\n\nReceive the action ID, ticket details, proposed action,\nand saved response draft from CSR-01.\n\nEmail the reviewer with Approve and Disapprove options.\nWait for their response, then route the decision.\n\nSetup\nReconnect Gmail credentials and configure the reviewer email.\nApproval callbacks require a reachable n8n public URL.",
        "height": 224,
        "width": 464
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        16,
        208
      ],
      "id": "3995aa78-cc45-4db3-8349-f31756502118",
      "name": "Sticky Note1"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 2. Approved Response\n\nMatch the Action_Log record by action_id.\nSet approval_status to Approved and record approved_at.\n\nMatch the support ticket by ticket_id.\nSet processing_status to READY_TO_EXECUTE.\n\nThe response is now eligible for sending by CSR-03.\nNo customer email is sent in this branch.",
        "height": 208,
        "width": 464
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        608,
        -336
      ],
      "id": "daadb86a-dc58-489b-af3e-8090d342f2a6",
      "name": "Sticky Note2"
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## 3. Rejected Response\n\nMatch the Action_Log record by action_id.\nSet approval_status to Rejected and\nexecution_status to Cancelled.\n\nRecord that the reviewer declined the response.\n\nMatch the support ticket by ticket_id.\nSet processing_status to NEEDS_REVISION.\n\nA person must review and revise the response\nbefore it can be submitted for approval again.",
        "height": 240,
        "width": 416
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
